<title>USA: Cardinal names John Penn president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Cardinal names John Penn president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Ky. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cardinal Bancshares Inc said on Tuesday it has elected John Penn president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Penn, who was president and chief operating officer, replaces James Mahan III as Cardinal's chief executive officer, Cardinal said.</p>
<p>Mahan resigned to comply with a Federal Reserve System requirement that Cardinal and Security First Network Bank, an Internet bank that was spun off by Cardinal, terminate management and director interlocks, Cardinal said.</p>
</text>
